  "goodToKnow": "Die Prothese is a prosthesis: eine Arm-, Bein- or Hüftprothese, and colloquially dentures (Zahnprothese, also das Gebiss). German firm Ottobock, founded after WWI to help war amputees, is a world leader in prostheses. Paralympic long-jumper Markus Rehm competes with a carbon-fibre Sportprothese. Plural: die Prothesen."
